   "title": "Highlights",
   "intro": "",
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "A Yacht Crafted by Excellence",
     "text": "Designed by and for bold, adventurous spirits, the EIGHTY 3 is the fruit of combined talents, the meeting of brilliant naval architects with one of the world’s most respected builders of super yachts.\nHer design delivers 300 m² of dedicated exterior living space for relaxation, with an aft swim platform extending up to 22 m²."
    },
    {
     "title": "Precious Time for Smooth Cruising",
     "text": "Agile in coastal cruising, the EIGHTY 3 also offers 3,500 nautical miles of fuel autonomy, enabling you to travel the world with full peace of mind.\nOn board, the flush main deck offers a perfect connection with the environment.  Equipment for marine activities, such as a jet ski or tender, are ideal for making the most of an afternoon anchorage, with dedicated space to the aft of the yacht."
    },
    {
     "title": "An Homage to Savoir-Faire",
     "text": "Each detail is designed to be personalized.  The EIGHTY 3 features the spirit of a motor yacht with the distinctive personality of a Lagoon, with bespoke choices for furnishings, upholstery, and accessories.\nOn board, fine materials include a marble table, armchairs with braided leather seatbacks, decorative glass panels, natural stone countertops, and wooden furniture featuring a brushed finish."
    },
    {
     "title": "A Signature Suite for Bespoke Dreams",
     "text": "Inspired by contemporary architectural codes, each living space on board invites you to take full advantage of the natural light and breathtaking 360° ocean views.\nThe owner’s cabin features a king-sized berth with a view of the sea, a private terrace, and space for relaxation, designed to offer exceptional comfort."
    }
   ],
   "images": []
  }
 ],
